Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo yung mati, sayang din yun eh. We would want to help, support lalo na yung Caraga area.

7844
05:17:31,080 --> 05:17:43,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron din magkapatulong. Of course, yung sa Kamigin, probably submit us any updates sa Kamigin Airport. Siya ba pwede mag-satisfy? Kasi tinanong din niya, kukurisim area din.

7845
05:17:44,660 --> 05:17:46,500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po. Yung Kamigin Airport.

7846
05:17:46,540 --> 05:18:05,200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The same problem po. Maiksi ang runway. At right-of-way budget po para madagdagan natin, mapahaba natin ang runway. Ilang beses na po kami bumalik po dun. At ito po yung mga pagkakatuon din para ma-inspect natin mapantalan kasama ang PPA.

7847
05:18:05,200 --> 05:18:16,300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At nakapagtabi po kami ng meron pong budget na yun. I think in the amount of 250 million, if I'm not mistaken. But visaro po siya.

7848
05:18:16,540 --> 05:18:44,280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: 150 million. At iniingi po namin yan. Tapos meron na rin po kaming right-of-way na paunang budget na naibigay na rin namin. Download namin sa Kamigin po para masimula na rin po yung pagkukuha ng mga lote na kinakailangan. We need more budget, sir. At least yung unahin talaga namin yung runway. Para, again, mga jet po yung pwede na lumapag sa ating Kamigin.

7849
05:18:44,280 --> 05:18:46,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At mas mababa po.

7850
05:18:46,540 --> 05:18:47,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pagmasahe kung gano'n.

7851
05:18:49,460 --> 05:18:57,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And also, Kamigin, again, Mindanao din yan. That's a very big potential for tourism. Sayang din yun.

7852
05:19:00,280 --> 05:19:14,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With Marina, I'll just like to ask Marina. Miss Sonia Malaluan, ating administrator. Meron ba kayong plano na i-modernize yung sea service record ng Sea Man's Record Book?

7853
05:19:15,160 --> 05:19:16,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi nyo pa ba?

7854
05:19:16,540 --> 05:19:23,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Gagawing digitally verifiable, no? Para ang inyong immigration records kaysa physical passport, wet stamp.

7855
05:19:24,340 --> 05:19:35,100
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair, and with the permission of the Secretary. Sa ngayon po, may plano po. Kaya lang wala pa po talagang provision ng budget.

7856
05:19:35,100 --> 05:19:55,300
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Because ang pinaprioritize po namin, which we included in our budget proposal, is the tech refresh and the data center as well as the recovery system for the seafarer identity document and seafarer's record book issue 1 system.

7857
05:19:55,300 --> 05:20:03,020
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: But nakasama po yan sa medium term plan to have an electronic record book.

7858
05:20:03,020 --> 05:20:04,900
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Sa ngayon po, verifiable.

7859
05:20:05,100 --> 05:20:24,620
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: In terms of the validity of the record book as well as yung biometric features na nakarecord sa SID, included doon yung chip to have the biometric, facial biometric features.

7860
05:20:24,620 --> 05:20:29,880
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So kasama naman po as long as mag-provide po ng additional budget.

7861
05:20:30,260 --> 05:20:33,840
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Although hindi pa po namin naisama sa proposal ng 27.

7862
05:20:33,840 --> 05:20:49,800
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Because inuuna nga po namin na ma-refresh software and hardware of the SID-SRB system that started, which started its implementation in 2019.

7863
05:20:50,600 --> 05:21:00,660
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So develop po ito in 2018. So almost 8 years po. Walang update. Walang any revision since then up to now.

7864
05:21:00,660 --> 05:21:03,800
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Both in software and in hardware po.

7865
05:21:03,840 --> 05:21:16,640
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So we expect, actually we're experiencing frequent breakdown of the hardware because of that we need to replace na po the hardware and have an update on the software.

7866
05:21:17,280 --> 05:21:26,780
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So next po yung plan to have the electronic seafarer's record book together with the electronic training record book.

7867
05:21:27,080 --> 05:21:28,460
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So mayroon naman pong plano.

7868
05:21:31,120 --> 05:21:31,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

7869
05:21:32,360 --> 05:21:33,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Doon na lang sana sa ka-upcon.

7870
05:21:33,840 --> 05:21:40,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro yung sa update alin, ka-Kawayan, may nagpatanong dito yung sa Kawayan Airport.

7871
05:21:41,160 --> 05:21:48,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano pong update doon sa night capable, ano na, upgrading to night operations?

7872
05:21:49,100 --> 05:21:52,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron na ba tayong runway lights? Kasi sayang doon eh no?

7873
05:21:53,920 --> 05:21:56,920
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Good afternoon, Senator.

7874
05:21:58,060 --> 05:22:02,880
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Ready na po for night operations ang Kawayan.

7875
05:22:03,840 --> 05:22:06,500
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Naka-install na po ang ilaw.

7876
05:22:07,780 --> 05:22:12,320
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Inaantay na lang po natin ng konting widening ng area.

7877
05:22:13,160 --> 05:22:19,500
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: At saka, so we can initially operate it for takeoff.

7878
05:22:20,600 --> 05:22:23,820
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Pag na-widen na, isasama na natin yung landing.

7879
05:22:23,820 --> 05:22:29,280
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Meron din po tayong project na runway asphalt overlay ng Kawayan.

7880
05:22:29,520 --> 05:22:32,320
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: At ito ay nasa procurement process na po, Senator.

7881
05:22:32,600 --> 05:22:33,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang nasa mayata.

7882
05:22:33,840 --> 05:22:34,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa ano ito, no?

7883
05:22:35,860 --> 05:22:39,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa hindi na po doon for next year yung Kawayan?

7884
05:22:40,740 --> 05:22:42,540
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Ka-up corporate fund po.

7885
05:22:42,600 --> 05:22:44,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ah, sa Ka-up corporate fund. Okay.

7886
05:22:45,900 --> 05:22:47,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So ready na pala siya.

7887
05:22:48,640 --> 05:22:49,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's good.

7888
05:22:49,940 --> 05:22:56,280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may, meron din po tayong pondo ngayon sa 2026 itong ating Kawayan Airport.

7889
05:22:56,680 --> 05:23:00,820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Isa rin po ito sa hiningi natin, Fisaro din po ito para mailabas na rin po.

7890
05:23:01,180 --> 05:23:02,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, that's what I was...

7891
05:23:03,840 --> 05:23:05,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ...referring to actually.

7892
05:23:06,600 --> 05:23:12,560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: In the meantime po, gagamitin natin yung sa Ka-up naman while waiting for the funds from DBM po.

7893
05:23:13,600 --> 05:23:13,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

7894
05:23:14,400 --> 05:23:24,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro before we end, si Manager J, Attorney J Santiago, yung pong may nag-request doon na I think I brought this up with you.

7895
05:23:24,240 --> 05:23:29,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung tungkol sa Palawan, yung port doon, may update na ba tayo doon?

7896
05:23:29,940 --> 05:23:32,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sayang kasi, medyo mahal kasi yung ano daw doon eh.

7897
05:23:32,720 --> 05:23:33,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Cargo and shipment.

7898
05:23:33,840 --> 05:23:37,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because yung port na inaugurate, hindi naman daw nagamit.

7899
05:23:37,320 --> 05:23:40,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung panahon po, last administration pa.

7900
05:23:40,200 --> 05:23:41,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, what needs to be done?

7901
05:23:42,520 --> 05:23:43,740
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yes po, Mr. Chair.

7902
05:23:43,840 --> 05:23:49,320
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yung pong nire-refer nyo po, that is the ports of San Fernando and El Nido at saka Borac and Coron.

7903
05:23:49,880 --> 05:23:56,560
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: We are already in discussions po with the provincial government for the turnover po ng operation ng dalawang port na yon

7904
05:23:56,560 --> 05:23:59,320
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: because they requested that they be allowed to operate it.

7905
05:23:59,600 --> 05:24:03,420
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: So, it will be elevated po to the board ng PPA for approval.

7906
05:24:03,420 --> 05:24:08,480
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And hopefully, we will be able to turn it over to the provincial government po.

7907
05:24:08,540 --> 05:24:12,860
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yung operation for an initial three years po by October po, Chair.

7908
05:24:14,300 --> 05:24:15,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you.

7909
05:24:15,300 --> 05:24:20,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Please sana kung kinakailangan natin anything to supplement kasi sayang din ng Palawan eh.

7910
05:24:21,080 --> 05:24:26,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Medyo mahal kasi yung, it's very expensive, quite expensive yung shipping doon.

7911
05:24:26,580 --> 05:24:29,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo yung mga cargo and others.

7912
05:24:30,420 --> 05:24:33,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, since there are no more matters to discuss,

7913
05:24:33,420 --> 05:24:38,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we will submit the rest of our questions to the agencies for the appropriate answers.

7914
05:24:39,720 --> 05:24:42,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The committee chair would like to thank everyone,

7915
05:24:43,080 --> 05:24:47,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: our esteemed resource persons for actively participating in our discussions today.

7916
05:24:47,340 --> 05:24:48,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: There being no further questions,

7917
05:24:48,760 --> 05:24:55,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the budget of the Department of Transportation including its attached agencies and corporations,

7918
05:24:56,720 --> 05:25:00,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Civil Aeronautic Board, Maritime Industry Authority,

7919
05:25:00,880 --> 05:25:02,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Office of Transportation Cooperatives,

7920
05:25:02,340 --> 05:25:05,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Office for Transportation Security,

7921
05:25:06,300 --> 05:25:07,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Philippine Coast Guard,

7922
05:25:07,920 --> 05:25:08,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Toll Regulatory Board,

7923
05:25:09,260 --> 05:25:11,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Light Rail Transit Authority,

7924
05:25:12,460 --> 05:25:14,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and Philippine National Railways

7925
05:25:14,040 --> 05:25:17,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is now deemed submitted for the plenary's consideration.

7926
05:25:18,360 --> 05:25:21,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Subject to the discussion and submission of documents requested.

7927
05:25:22,360 --> 05:25:24,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This briefing is hereby suspended.

7928
05:25:24,540 --> 05:25:25,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, everyone.

7929
05:25:27,400 --> 05:25:31,580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chairman, on behalf of the men and women of the DOTR family po,

7930
05:25:31,580 --> 05:25:32,280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kami po'y lubos na

7931
05:25:32,340 --> 05:25:38,420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nagpapasalamat po sa inyo at kayo po ay consistently na champion po ng DOTR

7932
05:25:38,420 --> 05:25:44,020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at ito po'y tunay na nagpapakita ng inyong pagmamahal sa kagawaran ng transportasyon

7933
05:25:44,020 --> 05:25:46,140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at sa aming pong transport group at mananakay.

7934
05:25:46,220 --> 05:25:47,540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Salamat po ng maraming marami.

